  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Salt-bake the beef pieces for 20 minutes, or until lightly browned.",
    "In a large pan, heat oil over medium-high heat. Add onions and cook until lightly browned.",
    "Add garlic, cumin seeds, coriander seeds, and chilies. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add beef broth and diced tomatoes. Bring to a boil, then reduce heat to low and simmer for 10 minutes.",
    "Add the salt-baked beef to the pan and cook for 5 minutes.",
    "Stir in honey, if using.",
    "Transfer the pan to the preheated oven and bake for 30 minutes, or until the meat is tender.",
    "Garnish with parsley and serve hot.",
    "Serve with couscous or rice, if desired."
